Bypass Technique Checks

Each of these should return 401/403 on a patched instance:

Header injection:

bash
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" \
  -H "X-JFrog-Override-Base-Url: http://127.0.0.1" \
  https://<TARGET>/artifactory/api/security/users

IP spoof headers:

bash
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" \
  -H "X-Forwarded-For: 127.0.0.1" \
  -H "X-Real-IP: 127.0.0.1" \
  https://<TARGET>/artifactory/api/security/users

Path traversal:

bash
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" \
  --path-as-is \
  "https://<TARGET>/artifactory/api/repositories/..;/api/security/users"

Double slash:

bash
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" \
  --path-as-is \
  "https://<TARGET>//artifactory//api//security//users"

Path parameter bypass:

bash
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" \
  "https://<TARGET>/artifactory/api/security/users;jsessionid=x"

Anonymous basic auth:

bash
curl -sk -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}" \
  -H "Authorization: Basic YW5vbnltb3VzOg==" \
  https://<TARGET>/artifactory/api/system/configuration
